<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#F5F7FA',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', width: '100%', height: '100%', gap: 40 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 380, paddingTop: 20 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 12 }}>REVIEW DRIVEN</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.35, marginBottom: 24 }}>
        评审驱动开发：<br />流程 ≠ 质量
      </Text>
      <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, background: '#22D3EE', marginBottom: 24 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
        光让 AI 走完流程不等于写对了。每一步都要<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F' }}>主动提问、要它自查、逼它修复</span>，把评审嵌入开发而不是事后补。
      </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 0 }}>
        {[
          { t: '提问', d: '逼 AI 说清思路', icon: 'question' },
          { t: '建议', d: '指出问题与改进点', icon: 'comment-dots' },
          { t: '修复', d: '按反馈回炉修改', icon: 'wrench' },
          { t: '再提问', d: '确认改对了没有', icon: 'sync' },
        ].map((item, idx) => (
          <Box key={idx} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', flex: 1 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: idx === 1 ? '#16263F' : '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, padding: '18px 16px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)', alignItems: 'center' }}>
              <FAIcon name={item.icon} style={{ fill: idx === 1 ? '#FF9F1C' : '#22D3EE', width: 26, height: 26, marginBottom: 10 }} />
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: idx === 1 ? '#FFFFFF' : '#16263F', marginBottom: 4 }}>{item.t}</Text>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: idx === 1 ? '#DCE7F5' : '#5B6B7A', textAlign: 'center' }}>{item.d}</Text>
            </Box>
            {idx < 3 && (
              <Box style={{ width: 22, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <FAIcon name='arrow-right' style={{ fill: '#FF9F1C', width: 16, height: 16 }} />
              </Box>
            )}
          </Box>
        ))}
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ background: '#16263F', borderRadius: 12, padding: '18px 24px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
          <span style={{ color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>循环的关键</span>：不是走一遍就完，而是「提问 → 建议 → 修复 → 再提问」持续转，直到没有新问题。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 9 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>06 / 12</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
